+       * UAPI configuration precedence: a keyword already set by an earlier
+       * file is skipped by ssh_config_parse_line()'s "seen" table (see
+       * SOC_UNSUPPORTED..SOC_MAX handling), and that table is part of
+       * session->opts, so it persists across every ssh_config_parse_file()
